apple-itunes:1098999871.description:
FamCal: Organize Your Home, Elevate Your Love.
Manage all family chores and schedules in one place.
FEATURES:
FAMILY CALENDAR
- Share events with the whole family;
- Keep everyone synced with shared event updates;
- Set local notifications or notify others via the cloud;
- Switch between Month, Week, Agenda, and Text Month views;
- Assign unique colors to each member to view or add events by person.
SHARED LISTS & TASK DELEGATION
- Share grocery lists, shopping lists, work schedules, and more;
- Create task lists and to-dos, then notify a specific member or the whole family;
- Add dates and times to tasks to remind family members;
- Print, email your schedule, or export as ICS;
- Set list visibility to public, private, or shared with select family members.
SHARED FAMILY MEMOS & SPECIAL DAYS
- Share notes and jot down every precious moment;
- Attach photos to capture the moment in your memos;
- Share and store important contact info;
- Track Birthdays and Anniversaries;
- Add comments and chat with family on each memo.
SHARED FAMILY RECIPE BOX
- Keep and share all your family recipes in one place;
- Add ingredients to your shopping list with a single tap;
- Plan your meals on the calendar with ease;
- Add recipes manually or import them from a URL;
- Keep your screen on while cooking with our "No-Dim" toggle.
SHARED TRIP EXPENSES
- Keep all your family trips in one place;
- Track every expense throughout your trip;
- Use detailed charts to analyze all your travel expenses;
- Export all trip expenses as PDF or CSV files.
STAY CONNECTED & IN SYNC
Organize your calendar, projects, and notes anywhere, and access them on any device. The whole family shares one account; just log in with your own email address and the shared password.
One space for your whole crew.
FamCal isn’t just for families, it’s for any group that needs to stay in sync:
For Home: Manage chores and meal plans;
For School: Ace group projects and track deadlines;
For Life: Log shared expenses and plan trips. 
Subscription Information:
- Weekly and annual subscriptions are available;
- Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase;
- Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period;
- Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period, and identify the cost of the renewal;
- Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user's Account Settings after purchase.
